OL,3,ANine foreigners caught allegedly trying
OL,4,Ato leave South Africa to fight in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FNine foreigners have been arrested in
OL,8,FSouth Africa after they were caught
OL,9,Fallegedly trying to leave the country
OL,10,Fto fight in the war between Russia and
OL,11,Fthe Ukraine, police say.
OL,13,FThe group, aged between 20 and 26, were
OL,14,Farrested in and around Johannesburg by
OL,15,Fa multidisciplinary team on Sunday
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,18,FThey were caught as they were
OL,19,F"preparing to board flights out of the
OL,20,Fcountry", authorities added, but their
OL,21,Ffinal destination is unclear.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
