OL,3,ANine foreigners caught allegedly trying
OL,4,Ato leave South Africa to fight in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe group is accused of contravening
OL,8,FSouth Africa's laws, which outlaw
OL,9,Fmercenary activity without government
OL,10,Fpermission.
